# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — CI L0k 用裸 grep 判 application，conanfile 注释/docstring 里写 package_type="application" 会被误判为 CLI 并强制 commands.json ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-01
# Software: 通用（所有 archives/ 配方，尤其 package_type="library" 但依赖 application 包的）
# Gate: CI L0k (R38)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E2979
title: CI L0k 用 grep -c 'package_type.*=.*"application"' 扫整个 conanfile.py（含注释/docstring），在注释里解释「依赖 puredata 是 application 包」会被判成 CLI 工具并强制要求 commands.json，直接 L0 fail
trigger_tool: ci/conan/build_and_test.sh (L0k)
phase: lint
error_signature: \[fail\] L0k: CLI tool detected but commands.json missing \(R38\)|L0 quality gate failed: commands_json_r38
severity:               2
category:               tooling
match_keywords: L0k, commands.json, R38, package_type, application, detect_bindirs.py, quality gate, build_and_test.sh, docstring, grep
root_cause: L0k 判定 CLI 工具用三个启发式：`detect_bindirs.py`（AST，已正确忽略 `bindirs = []`）+
  `grep -cE 'RUNTIME[[:space:]]+DESTINATION[[:space:]]+bin\b|dst[[:space:]]*=[[:space:]]*["'"'"']bin["'"'"']'`
  + `grep -c 'package_type.*=.*"application"'`。后两条是**无上下文的文本 grep**，不区分注释、docstring
  与真实赋值，于是 recipe 里任何解释「依赖是 application 包」的注释都命中 `package_type.*=.*"application"`，
  被判成 CLI 工具 → 要求软件级 commands.json → 未提供即 L0 fail、CI 红灯。
  真正的 R38 口径是「构建产物含可执行文件」；插件（dlopen 加载的 ET_DYN，无 main()）不属于该口径。
rec_approach: avoid-package-type-application-literal-in-comments + run-local-ci-gate-before-push
verification_cmd:
  里唯一一处 `package_type="application"` 改写为「declared as an application package」后重跑，
  L0 全绿（22/22 测试断言 + L1/L1e/L4/L5 全过）。修复前 100% 复现。
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:               1
last_updated:               2026-10-19
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E2979.md
affected_scope:         CI L0k 用 grep -c 'package_type.*=.*"application"' 扫整个 conanf
verification_cmd:       # 以 source_pr CI 门禁为准（PR n/a）
rec_description:        avoid-package-type-application-literal-in-comments + run-local-ci-gate-before-push
